            "review_title": "Review at KVegetarian - Restaurant & Café",
            "review_text": "Marc P\n4 contributions\n1\nBuffet was great tasting, super affordable\nJul 2019 • Family\nWe were looking for a vegetarian restaurant and found this one using the Hotdeal.vn app. Didn't have high expectations as the buffet promotion was only 79,000 VND per person. Wow, what a terrific deal it was! The restaurant is set down the alley from the main street, very quiet and calm. And the staff was very friendly and attentive as we were the only customers. The food was all tasty and the tea was refreshing.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 20, 2019",
